        "sha256": "3fb3e767d812fd6b7450004cd11b501391b940bace8a9d9bbf4ccc5c0670e592",
        "signing_date": "1982-07-08",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_12370.txt",
        "text_sha256": "6ffd7fce8cdb511aa58f5759f52ff82284a499f46bca1f6b3dfa023c06f88cc9",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1982-07-12/pdf/FR-1982-07-12.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Section 1. E s t a b lis h m e n t  o f  th e  B o a r d . There is established effective July 10,  \n1982, a board of three members to be appointed by the President to investigate  \nthis dispute. No member of the board shall be pecuniarily or otherwise  \ninterested in any organization of railroad employees or any carrier."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2103,
      "char_start": 1955,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:12370#sec2",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 2.",
      "pdf_page": 9,
      "scope_id": "EO:12370#sec2",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "47 FR 30047, PDF pages 9-10",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "3fb3e767d812fd6b7450004cd11b501391b940bace8a9d9bbf4ccc5c0670e592",
        "signing_date": "1982-07-08",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_12370.txt",
        "text_sha256": "6ffd7fce8cdb511aa58f5759f52ff82284a499f46bca1f6b3dfa023c06f88cc9",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1982-07-12/pdf/FR-1982-07-12.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 2. R e p o r t. The board shall report its finding to the President with respect  \nto the dispute within 30 days from the date of its creation."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2504,
      "char_start": 2104,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:12370#sec3",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 3.",
      "pdf_page": 9,
      "scope_id": "EO:12370#sec3",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "47 FR 30047, PDF pages 9-10",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "3fb3e767d812fd6b7450004cd11b501391b940bace8a9d9bbf4ccc5c0670e592",
        "signing_date": "1982-07-08",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_12370.txt",
        "text_sha256": "6ffd7fce8cdb511aa58f5759f52ff82284a499f46bca1f6b3dfa023c06f88cc9",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1982-07-12/pdf/FR-1982-07-12.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 3. M a in t a in in g  C o n d it io n s . A s provided by Section 10 of the Railway  \nLabor Act, as amended, from the date of the creation of the Emergency Board  \nand for 30 days after the board has made its report to the President, no  \nchange, except by agreement, shall be made by the carriers or by their  \nemployees, in the conditions out of which the dispute arose.\n((\\ c n A J * £ x k ^"
    }
  ],
